<p>Aye Shabbar(a.s) ki Jaan Aye Farwa(s.a) ke chaand Noushahe Karbala<br />
Mai Tere khurbaan Aye Ammu ki shaan Noushahe Karbala</p>

<p>1. Tum jo karte ho talab mujhse izne wegha<br />
mai kaise du'n tumko izn mere beta<br />
tum ho nishaani, mere bhai ki Noushahe Karbala</p>

<p>2. Phir laaya Qasim(a.s) ne Taweez baba ki<br />
usme ye likhi thi tahreer baba ki<br />
meri taraf se, hoga fidya Noushahe Karbala</p>

<p>3. Padhte hi khat to Shabbir roye<br />
Bole Qasim ko gale se lagaake<br />
hai izn tumko, jao maidaa'n ko Noushahe Karbala</p>

<p>4. Ibne Hassan(a.s) jo chla madar ko chordh kar<br />
Kubra(s.a) ye kehti thi Qasim(a.s) se ro ro kar<br />
Jaate ho kyunkar, mujhko chordkar Noushahe Karbala</p>

<p>5. Maidaa'n me Jaakar shabbar(a.s) ke bete ne<br />
Azraq ko maarkar shabbar(a.s) ke bete ne<br />
Kaha ke chacha, pyaasa hai bada Noushahe Karbala</p>

<p>6. Ladta kaha'n tak bhala Noushahe Karbala<br />
Pyaasa kayi din ka tha Noushahe Karbala<br />
lagte hi khanjar, aaya zamee'n par Noushahe Karbala</p>

<p>7. Girne lage jab Qasim(a.s) dekha chacha ko<br />
Salaame Aakhir kiya apna chacha ko<br />
Haider(a.s) ka jamaal, hogaya Pamaal Noushahe Karbala</p>

